       Q: The priority order lists 'Throughput' three times instead of the actual contract KPIs (resource_efficiency, operator_fatigue_index, ambient_noise_level). When the optimiser cannot simultaneously improve efficiency while respecting both hard constraints, which KPI should dominate — and should fatigue or noise be the secondary safety guardrail?
