    5. machine_speed (decision variable bounds vs simultaneous noise and fatigue binding)
       Q: machine_speed is listed as a free decision variable with no minimum or maximum specified. At high speeds, both the noise constraint (80 dB) and the fatigue constraint (0.4) may become simultaneously active, leaving no feasible operating point. What is the maximum permissible machine_speed (e.g. as a percentage of rated capacity), and at what speed does the noise constraint typically become binding on your floor?
