    3. context.planning_horizon / shift duration
       Q: The planning horizon is 'single_shift' but no shift length is specified: is the shift 8 hours, 10 hours, or 12 hours? Both the fatigue index accumulation curve and the noise A-weighted TWA exposure limit are calibrated against shift duration, so an incorrect assumption changes feasibility.
