  [Escalation] Remediation options presented to manager:
    - Option 1 (Recommended): Expand Capacity via Shift Splitting and Noise Engineering Controls: Add a supplementary shift rotation (e.g., introduce a third partial shift or extend crew size) to distribute the 20% demand increase across more worker-hours, keeping each individual's FatigueIndex within the 0.40 ceiling. Simultaneously deploy engineering noise controls (acoustic dampening panels, machine enclosures, or quieter tooling) to bring floor noise back to or below 80.0 dB. No constraint limits are modified. This option has the highest upfront cost but fully protects workers and requires no governance waiver.
